<title>GERMANY: NORDIC COMBINED-TEAM SPRINT RESULT.</title>
<headline>NORDIC COMBINED-TEAM SPRINT RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Nordic combined World Cup</p>
<p>team sprint event:</p>
<p>1. Finland I (Hannu Manninen/Jari Mantila) 216.5 points for ski</p>
<p>jump, 35 minutes 1.9 seconds in 15-km cross-country</p>
<p>2. Norway I (Bjarte Engen Vik/Halldor Skard) 224.8/35:40.1/3.2</p>
<p>seconds behind</p>
<p>3. Austria I (Christoph Bieler/Mario Stecher)</p>
<p>231.5/37:40.2/1:34.3</p>
<p>4. Finland III (Tapio Nurmela/Kari Manninen)</p>
<p>196.3/35:22.7/1:47.8</p>
<p>5. Germany I (Jens Deimel/Sven Koch) 215.0/36:44.4/1:49.5</p>
<p>6. Norway III (Kristian Hammer/Gard Myhre) 199.3/35:46.4/1:58.5</p>
<p>7. Finland I (Samppa Lajunen/Tony Kilponen)</p>
<p>215.3/37:07.1/2:10.2</p>
<p>8. France I (Ludovic Roux/Sylvain Guillaume)</p>
<p>215.3/37:07.1/2:10.2</p>
<p>9. Austria II (Felix Gottwald/Christoph Eugen)</p>
<p>198.5/35:55.7/2:10.8</p>
<p>10. Norway II (Fred Borre Lundberg/Bard Jorgen Elden)</p>
<p>189.0/35:26.7/2:22.8</p>
